{"id": "UgzkMb-jIjV2KAZxzSB4AaABAg", "parent": null, "likes": 37, "text": "昔みたいにアニメを使わないスタイルでまたやってほしい。\n淡々と語ってくれる方が頭に入ってくる。", "published": "2026-09-01T22:11:43", "replies": 0, "creator": false}
{"id": "Ugz7QXGB-b9j6cKGytJ4AaABAg", "parent": null, "likes": 3, "text": "何故か学長の動画を見てる時だけ\n広告が流れ終わったあとにフリーズしちゃうんですよね.....\n何が原因なんでしょうか？", "published": "2026-09-02T00:57:32", "replies": 0, "creator": false}
{"id": "UgzrUz_Aspck_tJUsoF4AaABAg", "parent": null, "likes": 6, "text": "今みたいにアニメを使うスタイル分かりやすくて好き☺️\n非常に見やすい！", "published": "2026-09-02T08:53:10", "replies": 0, "creator": false}
{"id": "UgwNRTWRCpYJUYwNoOF4AaABAg", "parent": null, "likes": 2, "text": "ワシ、馬鹿じゃけ、よーわからん、でも継続する😄", "published": "2026-09-02T05:00:58", "replies": 0, "creator": false}
{"id": "Ugz6ay-KWi1CGJbk9kt4AaABAg", "parent": null, "likes": 1, "text": "おはいいね👍️✨️", "published": "2026-09-02T00:32:32", "replies": 0, "creator": false}
{"id": "UgyA_koejTfGbLw_3GV4AaABAg", "parent": null, "likes": 2, "text": "30年でS&Pは10倍。円安の今高々1.5倍。\n100円に戻ったとして、利益の方が買ってる。くだらない悩みです。", "published": "2026-09-04T10:25:32", "replies": 0, "creator": false}
{"id": "Ugw2KBaFGmHeDaIh6d14AaABAg", "parent": null, "likes": 5, "text": "円高→安く買える\n円安→資産額増える\nどちらもハッピー🎉", "published": "2026-09-01T22:38:47", "replies": 0, "creator": false}
{"id": "UgxNhw2XANgosvIo8zd4AaABAg", "parent": null, "likes": 0, "text": "親父が高齢で相続税2億円用意してたんだけど、円高になったせいでタイミングを失った\n\n長生きしてくれぇ〜泣", "published": "2026-09-10T22:52:02", "replies": 0, "creator": false}
{"id": "Ugysn80yCwH59AwGIlF4AaABAg", "parent": null, "likes": 6, "text": "１ドル130円くらいの時もそれ言ってる人多かったですね", "published": "2026-09-01T23:29:45", "replies": 0, "creator": false}
